      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:FortuneTeller_Photo_0c5ab77",
      "source": "FortuneTeller: Ну как?",
      "target": "FortuneTeller: Na, milyen?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-464.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16009,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451863814144",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:FortuneTeller_Photo_032121c",
      "source": "FortuneTeller: Будь осторожен. Моя аура может и ослепить!",
      "target": "FortuneTeller: Légy óvatos. Az aurám még meg is vakíthat!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-464.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
